action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P114 on macOS, GtkBackend only (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): GTK's Back shortcut Alt+Left -- Option+Left on a Mac keyboard -- pops the NavigationStack. AppKit does not take Option+Left as Back, so this file fails there by design.
# Pushes go through the drawn controls (taplabel); the pop off Leaf is Command-[ and every other pop is Option+Left. GTK puts the focus in Leaf's text field when Leaf is pushed, and Option+Left with the caret in a field moves one word, as in any Mac text field (2026-10-29). One Option+Left at the root must change nothing.
# Pass: the replay reports replayed; the log shows depths 1 2 3 2 1 0 1 in that order (no second 0); the final capture shows the Fruits screen under a "‹ Home" back control.
# P114 在 macOS 上，僅限 GtkBackend(TEST_BACKEND=gtk4):GTK 的返回快捷鍵 Alt+Left——Mac 鍵盤上的 Option+Left——彈出 NavigationStack。從 Leaf 返回用 Command-[:推入 Leaf 時 GTK 把焦點放進它的文字框，而插入點在文字框內時 Option+Left 往左移一個字，與任何 Mac 文字框相同(2026-10-29)。AppKit 不把 Option+Left 當成返回，所以本檔在那裡依設計會失敗。通過條件見上方英文說明。
